                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3dbf9a7a-9fc2-3cec-b2c4-ba99b15cb668",
                        "entry_id": "d7dc404a-903f-3d2c-a60b-1ea3cfc15077",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Bald, hairless; smooth."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4b517103-008c-4d88-a9a7-9f5ff58f06b1",
                                "sense_id": "3dbf9a7a-9fc2-3cec-b2c4-ba99b15cb668",
                                "text": "[T]he Vernacula or French Elm, whoſe leaves are thicker, and more florid, glabrous and ſmooth, delighting in the lower and moiſter grounds, where they will ſometimes riſe to above an hundred foot in height; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f5a7c285-d654-4a0a-bb3e-1001b24868a7",
                                "sense_id": "3dbf9a7a-9fc2-3cec-b2c4-ba99b15cb668",
                                "text": "[Crotalaria obtecta] Stems tall, erect, branched: stipules not decurrent: leaves simple, usually glabrous on the upper side: […] legumes oblong, many-seeded, glabrous or softly pubescent.",
                                "translation": "Preliminary Publication of the Flora of the Peninsula of Oriential India",
                                "english": "Preliminary Publication of the Flora of the Peninsula of Oriential India"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1a16c16a-b240-47a0-9e59-ce7b61c558f6",
                                "sense_id": "3dbf9a7a-9fc2-3cec-b2c4-ba99b15cb668",
                                "text": "'I am bound by precedent,' said the First Lord, turning a vast glabrous expressionless face from Harte to Sir Joseph."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f927ac0d-3ec2-4c1e-8041-6d3c3364420a",
                                "sense_id": "3dbf9a7a-9fc2-3cec-b2c4-ba99b15cb668",
                                "text": "Adriaan rose, pulling out his limbering glabrous cock, his eyes happy."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "08ff37da-15a7-4a48-b94c-f8834a967797",
                                "sense_id": "3dbf9a7a-9fc2-3cec-b2c4-ba99b15cb668",
                                "text": "The glabrous old head cranks round on him, stiff and slow, until the clouded eyes draw level with his own."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3c54476a-08f5-4601-8b5c-925f72294755",
                        "source_entry_id": "d7dc404a-903f-3d2c-a60b-1ea3cfc15077",
                        "source_sense_id": "3dbf9a7a-9fc2-3cec-b2c4-ba99b15cb668",
                        "source_sense_description": "bald, hairless — see also bald, hairless",
                        "target_lang_word": "glabre",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "glabre",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "12e4de1c-83a1-32ae-92f2-2f0c74ccd3da",
                                        "entry_id": "9bec82a5-0f9b-3545-bfd7-8524a49c5643",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est sans poils, sans duvet."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16c1df3a-f06f-45a6-b084-8270698286f2",
                                                "sense_id": "12e4de1c-83a1-32ae-92f2-2f0c74ccd3da",
                                                "text": "Il y a moins d’un siècle à peine, en France, seuls étaient glabres les hommes d’Église et les domestiques. Barbes fluviales des socialistes et des anarchistes, favoris des libéraux et des maitres d’hôtel, impériale des bonapartistes, rouflaquettes des apaches, les visages affichaient les convictions politiques et les conditions sociales."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "165b1468-facd-4565-9649-2aafc370448c",
                                                "sense_id": "12e4de1c-83a1-32ae-92f2-2f0c74ccd3da",
                                                "text": "Il fut accueilli par une grande dame pâle, large de hanches, avec une verrue glabre placée près de l’une des narines de son nez bulbeux."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7fdef60c-8cbd-303a-a9db-5cb583b3d7d8",
                                        "entry_id": "9bec82a5-0f9b-3545-bfd7-8524a49c5643",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qualifie une plante ne portant pas de poil."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87cd7a8f-c297-4061-98f8-963e54ece2f7",
                                                "sense_id": "7fdef60c-8cbd-303a-a9db-5cb583b3d7d8",
                                                "text": "Ici, les styles en colonne glabre, et surtout les stipules des feuilles moyennes et supérieures beaucoup plus larges que celles du R. sempervirens (et même que ne le sont celles du R. arvensis dans la majorité des cas), avec leurs oreillettes aiguës divergentes, le rapprochent de ce dernier."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b162b6da-b4c5-432e-84e9-90f49364e10a",
                                                "sense_id": "7fdef60c-8cbd-303a-a9db-5cb583b3d7d8",
                                                "text": "Tige, feuille glabre."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
